      "text": "Developing ideas"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 1820,
      "end_ms": 4220,
      "text": "Activity 1"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 5000,
      "end_ms": 6900,
      "text": "Listen to the news"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 8000,
      "end_ms": 10700,
      "text": "What problems does Christmas bring?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12180,
      "end_ms": 16980,
      "text": "Welcome to news today. Christmas is coming."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 18020,
      "end_ms": 21980,
      "text": "It brings joy but also waste and pollution."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 21980,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "Each year, for example, people in the UK use about 365,000 kilometres of paper for gifts."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 34400,
      "end_ms": 38780,
      "text": "Around the world, people throw away millions of turkeys."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 39660,
      "end_ms": 48420,
      "text": "What's more, people cut down nearly 120 million trees to use as Christmas trees."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 48420,
      "end_ms": 53680,
      "text": "But after Christmas, they often throw the trees away."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 54780,
      "end_ms": 61240,
      "text": "Some families are buying plastic Christmas trees, but they can cause pollution too."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62540,
      "end_ms": 65440,
      "text": "We should think about new ways of celebrating."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 66740,
      "end_ms": 69640,
      "text": "Let's have a green Christmas this year."
    }
  ],
